			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3651353">
									

<p>I believe that there are a few misunderstandings here that make the Foundation come off as more inept than they are depicted.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Not to mention the fraudulent account can be found by just asking Ed from accounting (for one site) - is he in on it, and if not, how does he explain the figures? None of this makes sense.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Ed does not know of the Swiss Bank Account. There are 2 degrees of separation between that account and what is considered common knowledge in accounting (the official Foundation account is fed by fronting companies which are fed by the Swiss Bank Account). So, most of the people at the Foundation have no need to explain the numbers.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>A Site Director admits that the Foundation is willing to kill its own personnel at the request of a celebrity donor - and no-one expects that to be a problem?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>While I realize that &quot;terminate&quot; is generally used to mean kill when used by the Foundation, this was intended to be read as either &quot;we will kill you&quot; or &quot;we will fire you&quot;. It was left intentionally vague, but in such a place that one could assume the latter.</p>

